Error [jet.CompileTimeReadsRuntimeValue]: This compile-time code reads `n`, a run-time value of the function around it
  --> tests/ui/prep_runtime_input.jet:4:25
    |
  4 |     doubled: comptime { n * 2 }
    |                         ^
 Why: Compile-time code runs once while building, before any call of the function, so `n` has no value yet.
 Fix: Compute the value at run time without `comptime`, or read a constant or a `comptime` value instead of `n`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0640
